CHAPTER.VERS:
But Pharaoh will not listen to you

          {+}
        , and I will lay my hand on Egypt, and bring forth my hosts, my people the sons of Israel, out of the land of Egypt by great judgments.

When Pharaoh will speak to you

          {+}
        , saying, Show a wonder for yourselves; then you will say to Aaron, Take your rod, and cast it down before Pharaoh, that it becomes a serpent.
